{"name":"Aspirin mask","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":0,"casual":{"lead":["People crush aspirin tablets into a paste and apply it to the face for acne.","The idea rests on aspirin's relation to salicylic acid; no studies of the mask were found."],"sections":[{"h":"How it works","paras":["Aspirin converts to salicylic acid in the body; believers expect a similar anti-acne effect topically, which is untested."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks and caveats","paras":["Documented warnings concern oral aspirin; topical risks are not described in the sources reviewed."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Things That Piss You Off","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/things-that-piss-you-off/163775","site":"T Nation · 7426 posts · 2011"},{"title":"Coronavirus - What Happened?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/coronavirus-what-happened/264503","site":"T Nation · 7175 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Blowjobs or Cheese?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/blowjobs-or-cheese/145287","site":"T Nation · 70 posts · 2010"},{"title":"Struggling to Eat in the Morning","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/struggling-to-eat-in-the-morning/175399","site":"T Nation · 43 posts · 2012"},{"title":"TRT and Elbow Tendinitis","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/trt-and-elbow-tendinitis/257572","site":"T Nation · 40 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Larry Scott FAQ","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/larry-scott-faq/123726","site":"T Nation · 30 posts · 2009"},{"title":"Muscle Sorness","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/muscle-sorness/20289","site":"T Nation · 21 posts · 2002"},{"title":"Supps to Help Heal Tendon/ Ligament","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/supps-to-help-heal-tendon-ligament/117248","site":"T Nation · 20 posts · 2008"},{"title":"Prime Time-Cause of DOMS","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/prime-time-cause-of-doms/48091","site":"T Nation · 17 posts · 2005"},{"title":"Aspirin or Ibuporfen","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/aspirin-or-ibuporfen/43529","site":"T Nation · 16 posts · 2